---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/components.css';
const schema = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Product", "name": "Large Living Spaces 60-80m\u00b2", "description": "Underground family houses, turnkey", "brand": {"@type": "Brand", "name": "Revonia"}, "offers": {"@type": "AggregateOffer", "priceCurrency": "GBP", "lowPrice": "199000", "offerCount": 1}, "manufacturer": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Luxury Modules", "url": "https://luxurymodules.co.uk", "description": "Official UK partner of Revonia. Turnkey vaulted living spaces, cellars and saunas."}};
---
<Layout title="Underground Houses 60-80m\u00b2 | Family Homes | Luxury Modules" description="Underground houses from 60-80m\u00b2: full family homes with a 100-year design life and near net-zero running costs. Turnkey delivery, planning included." schema={schema}>
<div class="pagehero">
  <p class="kicker">Range 03 · 60–80m²</p>
  <h1>Large living spaces: underground houses (60–80m²)</h1>
  <p>This is a house, not a garden room. A full underground house for a family: cross-vaulted ceilings, open layouts, optional saunas and spas, with near net-zero running costs and a 100-year design life.</p>
  <div class="price-anchor">From £199,000</div>
  <div style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn" href="/book-a-call/">Book a Scoping Call</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="#brochure" style="margin-left:8px">Download Brochure</a></div>
</div>
<div class="strip">Official UK Partner of <b>Revonia</b> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>1,500+</b> projects across Europe &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>25-year</b> structural warranty &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Planning <b>handled for you</b></div>
<div class="imgph hero"><img class="real" src="/images/modular-60-exterior.jpg" alt="Aerial view of a large living space with terrace and hot tub set into woodland"><span class="lbl">ASSET: modular-60-exterior.jpg — range hero</span></div>
<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Models</p><h2>Modular 60 and Modular 80</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="grid cols2">
    <div class="card"><div class="imgph "><img class="real" src="/images/modular-60-interior.jpg" alt="Modular 60 open-plan interior with cross-vaulted ceiling and arched glazing"><span class="lbl">ASSET: modular-60-interior.jpg — final</span></div>
      <div class="body"><h3>Modular 60</h3><div class="size">60m&sup2; &middot; 2&ndash;3 bedrooms &middot; 3 options</div><p>Big open living with 2&ndash;3 bedrooms, optional sauna, and a cross-vaulted module that extends living outdoors. Built for hosting.</p><div class="price">From &pound;199,000</div></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="imgph "><img class="real" src="/images/modular-80-exterior.jpg" alt="Modular 80 exterior at dusk with lit arched windows"><span class="lbl">ASSET: modular-80-exterior.jpg — final</span></div>
      <div class="body"><h3>Modular 80</h3><div class="size">80m&sup2; &middot; 2&ndash;4 bedrooms</div><p>Our largest home. Two to four bedrooms, customised to suit &mdash; the childhood home your grandkids will tell stories about.</p><div class="price">From &pound;275,000</div></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="navy-band"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Under the Surface</p><h2>How an underground house works</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:34px">Can you build an underground room in your garden in the UK? Yes &mdash; and done properly, it outperforms anything above ground. Here is what makes it work.</p>
  <div class="grid cols4">
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Structure</h3><p>Precast vaulted concrete modules, craned in and connected on site. The vault is the strongest shape in construction &mdash; the earth above adds protection, not load problems.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Waterproofing</h3><p>Geomembrane wrapping as standard, with drainage designed at site survey. Dry is not an aspiration; it is the spec.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Light</h3><p>Full-height arched glazing on the exposed facade, sky windows where the design allows. These are bright homes &mdash; the photography is not lying.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Air</h3><p>Designed ventilation with heat recovery keeps air fresh and humidity controlled, year round, silently.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="imgph half contain"><img class="real" src="/images/modular-40-floorplan.jpg" alt="Top-down cutaway render of a vaulted modular home"><span class="lbl">STAND-IN: modular-40-floorplan.jpg — true engineering cutaway still wanted</span></div>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Long Game</p><h2>Running costs and lifespan</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead">Earth-sheltering means the ground does most of your heating and cooling. Owners report running costs near net-zero with a modest solar array &mdash; and the structure is designed for 100 years, warrantied for 25. Compare that with the 60-year design life of a conventional new build.</p>
</div></section>

<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Beyond One Home</p><h2>Multi-unit and commercial use</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:26px">Large living spaces run as premium holiday lets and estate accommodation at nightly rates standard cabins cannot reach. See <a href="/commercial/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">the commercial case</a> or the <a href="/spaces/glamping-pods/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">glamping &amp; holiday parks</a> page.</p>
</div></section>
<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">FAQ</p><h2>Your questions, answered</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Is an underground house dark or damp?</h3><p>No. Full-height arched glazing floods the living space with light, and geomembrane waterproofing plus designed ventilation keep it drier than most conventional homes.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>What does an underground house cost?</h3><p>Modular 60 from £199,000; Modular 80 from £275,000, turnkey. Final pricing follows the scoping call and site assessment, because groundworks vary by site.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>How long does it take to build?</h3><p>The modules install in days. End to end — scoping, design, planning (which we handle) and build — allow roughly six months.</p></div>
  <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14.5px">More questions? <a href="/faq/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">See the full FAQ</a>.</p>
</div></section><section class="ctaband" id="cta">
  <h2>The authority on underground living</h2>
  <p>Talk to us about your site and what 60–80m² of buried architecture could do with it.</p>
  <div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/book-a-call/">Book a Scoping Call</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#brochure">Download the Brochure</a></div>
  
  <!-- BUILD NOTE: brochure CTA = HubSpot email-only form (hidden fields: product_interest, product_range, audience_type, source_page_url). Scoping CTA -> contact.html until /book-a-call/ with calendar embed exists. -->
</section>
</Layout>
